  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with the boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d776986526e41d967ae4f6/step-eba86300.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato and brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a medium heatproof bowl, combine 1/2 the garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave for 10 second bursts until fragrant.\n• Add yoghurt to garlic oil mixture and combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d776986526e41d967ae4f6/step-f879ff10.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion and tomato until softened, 5-6 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, and add lentils, chermoula spice blend, tomato paste and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the stock powder, coconut milk and the water and cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add baby spinach and butter, stirring, until melted and wilted, 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d776986526e41d967ae4f6/step-bbd78120.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice between bowls.\n• Top with chermoula lentil stew and garlic yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d776986526e41d967ae4f6/step-e56a7530.jpeg"
    }
  ]
